## 🚀 Built NEXUS CMD – AI Satellite Mission Control & Predictive Risk Analysis Platform

Excited to share my latest full-stack project: NEXUS CMD, a next-generation aerospace mission control platform designed to monitor satellite constellations, analyze telemetry streams, and predict mission risks before failures occur.

## 🛰️ Key Features

✅ Real-Time Satellite Telemetry Monitoring

✅ AI-Powered Predictive Risk Analysis

✅ Mission Timeline & Event Tracking

✅ Intelligent Mission Copilot

✅ Automated Alert Management System

✅ Interactive 3D Orbit Visualization

✅ Secure JWT Authentication & Role-Based Access Control

## 💡 What It Does

The platform continuously receives telemetry data such as:

🔋 Battery Levels

🌡️ Temperature

⚙️ CPU Utilization

📡 Signal Strength

⚡ Power Consumption

⏱️ Communication Latency

Using a custom Risk Analysis Engine, the system evaluates satellite health, generates alerts, predicts potential failures, and recommends mitigation actions.

